    "abstract": "Parts list for the aft engine mount fittings at the pylon rib, listing the one-piece shear tie, the forward cleat, the intercostals and the fastener set that attaches the mount to the rib.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the detail parts of the aft engine mount fittings at the pylon rib, for one pylon.",
      "figure_note": "Item 10 is the one-piece shear tie and is supplied machined and ready to drill at assembly. The figure covers one pylon and both pylons use the same parts list. Fastener quantities are per pylon. The mount microswitch and the mount position actuator brackets are shown for location only and are listed in the systems figure."
