    "abstract": "Parts list for the aft engine mount fittings at the pylon rib, listing the one-piece shear tie and the two-piece assembly with its splice plate as alternates that are not interchangeable in either direction.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the detail parts of the aft engine mount fittings at the pylon rib, for one pylon.",
      "figure_note": "Item 10 is the two-piece shear tie assembly with its splice plate and item 10A is the earlier one-piece item; they are alternates and are not interchangeable in either direction, because the pylon rib drilling differs and the two-piece halves cannot be closed on the one-piece pattern. Order strictly against the embodiment standard recorded for the aircraft: a one-piece airframe issued with item 10 receives two halves it cannot fit, and a modified airframe issued with item 10A receives a tie it cannot withdraw. Item 100 is the washer set for the splice joint and applies only with item 10. The figure covers one pylon and both pylons use the same parts list. Fastener quantities are per pylon. The mount microswitch and the mount position actuator brackets are shown for location only and are listed in the systems figure."
    },
